    "title": "Asgard/NOTT: L-band nulling interferometry at the VLTI IV. Prospects for characterising hot exozodiacal dust",
    "title_pt": "Asgard/NOTT: L-band nulling interferometry at the VLTI IV. Prospects for characterising hot exozodiacal dust",
    "title_en": "Asgard/NOTT: L-band nulling interferometry at the VLTI IV. Prospects for characterising hot exozodiacal dust",
    "sub": "Near-infrared interferometric surveys have revealed extended emission around the photosphere of $\\approx 40$ main-sequence stars, attributed to the presence of hot exozodiacal.",
    "sub_pt": "Near-infrared interferometric surveys have revealed extended emission around the photosphere of $\\approx 40$ main-sequence stars, attributed to the presence of hot exozodiacal.",
    "sub_en": "Near-infrared interferometric surveys have revealed extended emission around the photosphere of $\\approx 40$ main-sequence stars, attributed to the presence of hot exozodiacal.",
    "excerpt": "Near-infrared interferometric surveys have revealed extended emission around the photosphere of $\\approx 40$ main-sequence stars, attributed to the presence of hot exozodiacal dust. A promising technique for investigating this phenomenon.",
